{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of the mean, median, and mode of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a37bf51d47fe50e6b138dd3bc32e0abed2eccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2,3,0,3,1,4,0,3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/9/229f1be64248a42d0b1214a5b129146c6f600531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 7\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7.5\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8.5\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"391\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Putting the numbers in numerical order we get the list <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22e918085ad1f0956b964464e4ae363c6098769e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,0,1,2,3,3,3,4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\nThe mode is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93032f1ab8b685d84a767a2fde0d9006a464b5e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> The median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8e79569397eaa7ec8b64f1592a0225e553275c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2+3}{2}=2.5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" /> The average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/0/bc08a10a5bf0f4a95b8b295f86e546b36b98a331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{0+0+1+2+3+3+3+4}{8}=\\frac{16}{8}=2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"315\" height=\"37\" /> The sum of all three is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/3/7438a9422623a6f24bde5807162ec4c5e7739948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+2.5+2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"179\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/51K3uCzntWs?t=209\">https://youtu.be/51K3uCzntWs?t=209</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EEbksvfujhk\">https://youtu.be/EEbksvfujhk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Bxscjb2WaSw\">https://youtu.be/Bxscjb2WaSw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\